WEBVTT

00:00:03.920 --> 00:00:07.630
It's the Maiami Championship 
Junior Youth Qualifiers!

00:00:07.630 --> 00:00:12.920
The survivors of the 24-hour battle royal

00:00:12.920 --> 00:00:16.900
are returning here, to LDS center court!

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:21.360
Please give them a warm round of applause!

00:00:34.210 --> 00:00:36.630
That's Yuya!

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:38.420
Yuzu's there, too!

00:00:50.820 --> 00:00:53.720
It looks like Michy lost, though...

00:00:53.720 --> 00:00:56.440
But we still have two remaining 
from the You Show School!

00:00:56.440 --> 00:00:57.930
It gives me shivers!

00:00:57.930 --> 00:01:00.370
Shivers! Shivers!

00:01:06.770 --> 00:01:10.200
Yuya and Yuzu both look pretty tired.

00:01:10.200 --> 00:01:12.890
Gongenzaka looks the same as ever, though.

00:01:12.890 --> 00:01:15.050
But what's Sawatari doing there?

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:19.260
I thought he lost to Yuya in the first round!

00:01:19.680 --> 00:01:21.460
Now that you mention it,

00:01:21.790 --> 00:01:24.870
that Mieru girl lost to the ninja Tsukikage, also...

00:01:25.970 --> 00:01:28.330
Sawatari is that politician's son.

00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:30.400
You mean the city councilor?

00:01:31.350 --> 00:01:33.370
Coasting on your family's power isn't fair!

00:01:33.370 --> 00:01:36.170
Did you cheat to overturn the results?

00:01:37.380 --> 00:01:38.750
That's right!

00:01:38.750 --> 00:01:43.070
Don't think that just because your father's a city 
councilor, you'll be forgiven for anything!

00:01:44.020 --> 00:01:46.090
Shut up, all of you!

00:01:46.090 --> 00:01:48.090
I didn't cheat!

00:01:48.470 --> 00:01:53.470
Reiji Akaba granted me the right to get 
back in the game, fair and square.

00:01:53.470 --> 00:01:57.330
I won, and now I stand here as 
a member of the Lancers!

00:01:57.330 --> 00:01:58.600
Lancers?

00:01:58.600 --> 00:02:00.360
What? What are they?

00:02:00.360 --> 00:02:02.030
What are the Lancers?

00:02:02.790 --> 00:02:06.770
I-I'm not! I'm not a part of the Lancers—

00:02:07.100 --> 00:02:08.600
Forgive the interruption.

00:02:08.600 --> 00:02:10.920
As one of the tournament organizers,

00:02:10.920 --> 00:02:14.750
I have an urgent announcement for you all.

00:02:15.400 --> 00:02:19.450
As of noon today, the Maiami Championship

00:02:19.970 --> 00:02:22.050
is canceled.

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:37.300
Implementing mass into Solid Vision 
has created Action Duels.

00:02:37.300 --> 00:02:42.080
In duels where the field, monsters 
and duelists become one,

00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:45.080
the people are caught in a frenzy of excitement!

00:04:19.100 --> 00:04:23.880
Be Reborn, Legendary Gang Boss!!

00:04:24.420 --> 00:04:26.830
The reason we are stopping the championship

00:04:26.830 --> 00:04:31.870
is due to an enemy power's invasion of our world

00:04:31.870 --> 00:04:34.090
during the battle royal.

00:04:34.580 --> 00:04:38.790
Incredibly, they are from another dimension.

00:04:39.160 --> 00:04:43.500
They sent their front-line soldiers here,

00:04:43.940 --> 00:04:46.820
as part of a planned invasion of our dimension.

00:04:47.470 --> 00:04:51.470
They wield Duel Monsters cards as weapons,

00:04:51.740 --> 00:04:57.420
using monsters summoned with 
Real Solid Vision to attack us.

00:04:58.020 --> 00:05:01.320
We did not stop the battle royal at the time because

00:05:01.320 --> 00:05:06.200
we did not want the people of Maiami City... 
no, of the entire world...

00:05:06.200 --> 00:05:09.580
to be thrown into panic.

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:11.790
We ask for your understanding.

00:05:14.730 --> 00:05:16.430
What's a dimension?

00:05:16.430 --> 00:05:17.850
Who are the invaders?

00:05:17.850 --> 00:05:20.140
She said they use Duel Monsters as weapons.

00:05:20.140 --> 00:05:21.930
No way!

00:05:21.930 --> 00:05:26.710
Well, this is only one part of it, but please 
watch this video from the scene.

00:05:34.450 --> 00:05:36.480
Wh-What is that?

00:05:36.480 --> 00:05:37.920
He was turned into a card.

00:05:37.920 --> 00:05:41.090
Can that be the reason Hokuto is missing...

00:05:41.090 --> 00:05:43.390
Because he was turned into a card like that?

00:05:43.390 --> 00:05:48.360
Indeed, that is how Academia does things.

00:05:48.360 --> 00:05:50.600
They defeat their opponents in duels,

00:05:50.600 --> 00:05:53.370
and turn them into cards, without mercy!

00:05:53.910 --> 00:05:56.670
If they lose the duel, they're turned into cards?

00:05:56.670 --> 00:05:57.840
That's ridiculous!

00:05:57.840 --> 00:05:59.800
Is that true?

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:01.160
It can't be.

00:06:01.160 --> 00:06:04.080
Th-That doesn't give me shivers at all...

00:06:07.200 --> 00:06:10.440
But let me put you at ease.

00:06:10.850 --> 00:06:13.020
These cruel invaders

00:06:13.020 --> 00:06:18.190
were repelled by the battle royal's heroic duelists.

00:06:18.190 --> 00:06:20.020
Every one of them!

00:06:32.140 --> 00:06:33.290
All right!

00:06:33.290 --> 00:06:34.360
Cool!

00:06:34.360 --> 00:06:36.360
They beat all the enemies!

00:06:45.420 --> 00:06:47.120
Th-That's...

00:06:47.120 --> 00:06:48.320
Sora?!

00:06:49.810 --> 00:06:53.430
These are the heroes who protected Maiami City!

00:06:53.430 --> 00:06:57.840
I name them the Lance Defense Soldiers...

00:06:57.840 --> 00:07:00.670
in other words, the Lancers...

00:07:00.670 --> 00:07:03.610
to celebrate their great achievement!

00:07:05.170 --> 00:07:06.840
Lancers!

00:07:06.840 --> 00:07:08.140
Lancers!

00:07:08.490 --> 00:07:10.170
Lancers!

00:07:10.170 --> 00:07:11.930
Lancers!

00:07:11.930 --> 00:07:13.080
Lancers!

00:07:13.520 --> 00:07:15.260
Lancers!

00:07:15.260 --> 00:07:17.030
Lancers!

00:07:17.350 --> 00:07:19.040
They repelled the enemy.

00:07:19.040 --> 00:07:20.920
Was Sora an enemy?

00:07:20.920 --> 00:07:23.070
No way! That can't be true!

00:07:23.070 --> 00:07:26.020
He's right! Sora's one of us!

00:07:26.500 --> 00:07:30.880
But Sora wasn't taking part in the battle royal...

00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:34.200
Maybe he was going to be in a comeback 
battle, like Sawatari.

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:37.130
Then, why was he fighting Yuya?

00:07:37.130 --> 00:07:40.090
All the others were fighting enemies...

00:07:40.090 --> 00:07:43.930
You're saying they were somehow the 
only ones fighting a normal duel?!

00:07:44.930 --> 00:07:49.480
The Lancers' heroic deeds ensured 
the danger has passed for now.

00:07:49.760 --> 00:07:53.690
But we do not know when the 
enemy might attack again.

00:07:54.050 --> 00:07:56.000
To prepare for that,

00:07:56.000 --> 00:08:00.410
in the name of self-defense,

00:08:00.410 --> 00:08:04.060
I wish you all to train even harder for your duels.

00:08:04.060 --> 00:08:09.570
To do so, we, LDS, shall offer 
the location and curriculum!

00:08:09.570 --> 00:08:13.680
You, here, will become the next Lancers!

00:08:14.500 --> 00:08:16.360
We'll be next?

00:08:16.950 --> 00:08:18.580
To join the Lancers...

00:08:20.450 --> 00:08:21.900
We'll join...

00:08:21.900 --> 00:08:23.280
...the Lancers.

00:08:24.340 --> 00:08:26.220
The world has changed.

00:08:27.590 --> 00:08:31.490
The peace you took for granted 
is now a thing of the past.

00:08:31.960 --> 00:08:35.730
Understand that you are now 
living in an age of war.

00:08:36.230 --> 00:08:40.170
The place formerly known as the world-renowned 
Leo Defense School

00:08:40.170 --> 00:08:45.200
will now forge the first line of defense, 
the Lance Defense Soldiers.

00:08:50.410 --> 00:08:55.380
And I, Reiji Akaba, will fight as one of those Lancers.

00:08:58.690 --> 00:09:00.960
The word "Lancers" refers to soldiers

00:09:00.960 --> 00:09:04.820
who rode a horse, spear in hand, into enemy lines.

00:09:05.320 --> 00:09:08.620
I make this promise to the world today.

00:09:09.120 --> 00:09:11.530
I will annihilate our enemy.

00:09:11.530 --> 00:09:16.470
Lancers! Lancers! Lancers!

00:09:16.470 --> 00:09:21.680
Lancers! Lancers! Lancers!

00:09:21.680 --> 00:09:24.780
Lancers! Lancers!

00:09:31.080 --> 00:09:32.590
Where's Yuzu?

00:09:32.590 --> 00:09:34.030
Why didn't she come?

00:09:34.030 --> 00:09:35.920
She was with you earlier.

00:09:39.620 --> 00:09:42.490
I-Isn't that... Yuzu's...

00:09:47.590 --> 00:09:50.860
Yuya, why do you have that?

00:09:50.860 --> 00:09:52.140
I'm sorry. I...

00:09:52.850 --> 00:09:54.340
I couldn't protect Yuzu.

00:09:55.510 --> 00:09:57.310
What do you mean you couldn't protect her?

00:09:57.310 --> 00:09:59.740
She was just with you!

00:09:59.740 --> 00:10:03.030
Yeah, she returned to center court with you.

00:10:03.520 --> 00:10:07.320
Sh-She didn't... That wasn't Yuzu.

00:10:08.800 --> 00:10:10.290
That wasn't Yuzu?

00:10:10.290 --> 00:10:11.890
What do you mean?

00:10:12.170 --> 00:10:14.940
That girl's name is Serena.

00:10:14.940 --> 00:10:17.100
She looks like Yuzu, but she's a different person.

00:10:17.440 --> 00:10:18.430
A different person?

00:10:18.720 --> 00:10:23.640
During the battle royal, they switched 
clothes and traded places.

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:25.340
Traded places?

00:10:25.340 --> 00:10:26.840
Why did they do that?

00:10:32.180 --> 00:10:36.750
Yuzu gave me the opportunity to 
learn the truth about Academia.

00:10:37.520 --> 00:10:39.610
The terrible things we were doing,

00:10:39.610 --> 00:10:42.220
while professing our own righteousness.

00:10:42.880 --> 00:10:45.840
If Yuzu has been kidnapped by Academia,

00:10:45.840 --> 00:10:49.830
then I shall do everything in my power to save her.

00:10:49.830 --> 00:10:53.580
I shall fight Academia, as well, 
as a member of the Lancers.

00:11:03.140 --> 00:11:04.670
I'll go, too!

00:11:04.670 --> 00:11:07.340
Where is this Academia?

00:11:07.340 --> 00:11:09.180
Tell me... Please tell me!

00:11:09.180 --> 00:11:11.820
Y-You can't go.

00:11:12.100 --> 00:11:14.000
Why do you say I can't?

00:11:14.000 --> 00:11:15.930
I'm a former pro duelist myself!

00:11:15.930 --> 00:11:18.540
I'll crush whoever did this, and take...

00:11:19.060 --> 00:11:20.780
take back Yuzu!

00:11:31.010 --> 00:11:33.970
Y-Yuzu was taken to another dimension.

00:11:35.120 --> 00:11:37.390
Yuzu's in another dimension.

00:11:37.390 --> 00:11:38.830
Another dimension?

00:11:38.830 --> 00:11:42.180
That's why we... the Lancers will go there.

00:11:42.180 --> 00:11:44.140
Who cares about the Lancers?

00:11:44.140 --> 00:11:47.880
What kind of heroes can't even 
protect their own team?!

00:11:47.880 --> 00:11:49.900
You were with her.

00:11:49.900 --> 00:11:52.700
Why... Why couldn't you save her?

00:11:53.860 --> 00:11:57.930
My darling didn't know Yuzu was being taken away!

00:11:57.930 --> 00:11:58.760
Enough!

00:11:58.760 --> 00:11:59.600
But...

00:12:00.050 --> 00:12:02.070
Try to understand how Yuya feels.

00:12:02.330 --> 00:12:03.610
But...

00:12:12.980 --> 00:12:14.300
Father...

00:12:18.720 --> 00:12:22.170
I'll save Yuzu. No matter what I have to do!

00:12:22.170 --> 00:12:23.150
Darling...

00:12:23.150 --> 00:12:25.360
To do that, I will cross dimensions!

00:12:26.050 --> 00:12:28.940
I'll fight with the Lancers alongside Reiji Akaba,

00:12:28.940 --> 00:12:32.880
become stronger than before, beat all our enemies,

00:12:32.880 --> 00:12:35.100
and bring back Yuzu, no matter what!

00:12:35.470 --> 00:12:38.940
When you say you'll beat your enemies, 
does that include Sora?

00:12:44.020 --> 00:12:46.360
What are you doing, Mom?

00:12:46.360 --> 00:12:49.460
Just come with me! The rest of you, too.

00:13:09.240 --> 00:13:12.140
Why did my darling's mama

00:13:12.140 --> 00:13:15.130
bring him and the others here?

00:13:32.740 --> 00:13:34.700
M-Mom?

00:13:34.700 --> 00:13:36.160
Why are you dressed like that?

00:13:36.580 --> 00:13:39.630
I'm not "Mom"! I am the boss of the ladies gang!

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:42.120
B-Boss?

00:13:42.120 --> 00:13:43.400
What's that?

00:13:43.400 --> 00:13:45.610
When Yoko was young,

00:13:45.610 --> 00:13:50.110
she headed up the much-feared 
Maiami City Ladies Team!

00:13:50.400 --> 00:13:54.850
Yes, we could scare a crying child into silence. 
Our name was the Maiami Queens!

00:13:56.070 --> 00:13:58.820
I was their boss, Shooting Star Yoko!

00:13:59.070 --> 00:14:01.670
Sh-Shooting Star?

00:14:01.670 --> 00:14:03.050
What are you talking about?

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:05.290
Action Field, on.

00:14:05.960 --> 00:14:09.110
I activate my Field Spell Pier of Peril!

00:14:20.910 --> 00:14:24.140
Pier of Peril

00:14:24.140 --> 00:14:25.880
I'll let you take the first turn.

00:14:26.140 --> 00:14:29.740
What nonsense is this? Give me a break already...

00:14:29.740 --> 00:14:31.880
Why should I duel you, Mom?

00:14:32.400 --> 00:14:34.350
I told you, I'm not "Mom"!

00:14:37.960 --> 00:14:42.160
I am Shooting Star Yoko, boss of the Maiami Queens!

00:14:47.060 --> 00:14:50.030
Hey, hey, hey, hey, hey!

00:14:50.390 --> 00:14:54.100
I love crushing my opponents in duels.

00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:57.320
Enemy teams, men who hit on me...

00:14:57.320 --> 00:14:59.310
I've taken them all out with my duels.

00:14:59.310 --> 00:15:02.510
But that's no reason to take me out!

00:15:03.380 --> 00:15:04.880
Come back here!

00:15:04.880 --> 00:15:08.220
Why does she want to duel so bad, 
she has to dress like that?

00:15:08.480 --> 00:15:11.100
Is she mad about the thing with Sora?

00:15:11.100 --> 00:15:14.430
She said something about how he'd have 
to beat Sora if he's an enemy...

00:15:14.430 --> 00:15:15.630
Of course he would.

00:15:15.630 --> 00:15:19.100
Sora's working with the guys who kidnapped Yuzu.

00:15:19.490 --> 00:15:21.930
Yuya... Shooting Star Yoko...

00:15:22.570 --> 00:15:25.770
Back then, duels were power to me.

00:15:26.560 --> 00:15:30.010
Duels were a way for me to show my strength.

00:15:34.150 --> 00:15:36.300
Of course, I had confidence in my skill.

00:15:36.300 --> 00:15:38.890
It was enough to beat even pro duelists.

00:15:38.890 --> 00:15:43.120
Enough! I'm not gonna forgive you, 
just because you're my mom!

00:15:45.030 --> 00:15:46.790
Then, come after me!

00:15:48.070 --> 00:15:49.920
Fine, let's do it!

00:15:49.920 --> 00:15:52.030
I just have to fight you, right?

00:15:58.760 --> 00:16:01.510
The duelists meet at the battlefield!

00:16:01.920 --> 00:16:04.880
Along with their monsters, they'll kick 
the ground and fly through the sky...

00:16:05.220 --> 00:16:07.080
...to move around the field!

00:16:07.330 --> 00:16:10.280
Witness dueling's greatest evolution.

00:16:10.780 --> 00:16:12.880
Action...

00:16:13.680 --> 00:16:14.520
Duel!

00:16:18.080 --> 00:16:21.480
I summon Performapal Salutiger from my hand!

00:16:24.660 --> 00:16:27.900
When a Performapal is summoned 
to my side of the field,

00:16:27.900 --> 00:16:32.600
I can Special Summon Performapal 
Helpprincess from my hand.

00:16:34.880 --> 00:16:36.840
Now I end my turn!

00:16:37.280 --> 00:16:38.890
Fight hard, my darling.

00:16:38.890 --> 00:16:41.210
Even if she is your mama, a battle's a battle!

00:16:41.210 --> 00:16:42.950
Looks like you're ready to fight!

00:16:42.950 --> 00:16:45.050
I won't let you beat me, Mom!

00:16:45.600 --> 00:16:49.790
When I was the boss of my gang, 
I got into fights every night.

00:16:50.520 --> 00:16:52.760
I dueled from morning till night.

00:16:55.490 --> 00:16:57.690
There was no counting the teams we crushed.

00:16:58.880 --> 00:17:00.950
Of course, I earned resentment.

00:17:00.950 --> 00:17:02.930
But I didn't care.

00:17:03.560 --> 00:17:06.400
In my mind, if they came after me for revenge,

00:17:06.400 --> 00:17:09.500
all I had to do was crush them again.

00:17:11.300 --> 00:17:14.650
To someone like me, with the confidence 
that I could beat pro duelists,

00:17:14.650 --> 00:17:17.210
the town's delinquents were garbage at best.

00:17:18.150 --> 00:17:22.360
But they didn't try to challenge 
me to a straight fight.

00:17:22.840 --> 00:17:26.820
They captured another member of my Maiami Queens

00:17:26.820 --> 00:17:29.110
to take revenge on me.

00:17:29.530 --> 00:17:31.260
That's dirty!

00:17:31.260 --> 00:17:33.870
We don't care if it's dirty.

00:17:33.870 --> 00:17:36.730
We just want to get even with you!

00:17:36.730 --> 00:17:38.670
You damn trash...

00:17:38.670 --> 00:17:41.160
If you wanna save your little friend,

00:17:41.160 --> 00:17:42.560
you'd better duel us again.

00:17:42.560 --> 00:17:43.870
All of us!

00:17:44.930 --> 00:17:46.070
Fine.

00:17:46.590 --> 00:17:48.280
Let's do it!

00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:51.150
My turn. Draw!

00:17:51.780 --> 00:17:56.120
When there are monsters on your 
side of the field but not on mine,

00:17:56.800 --> 00:18:01.190
I can Special Summon Road Raven Renegade.

00:18:07.870 --> 00:18:09.330
Road Raven Renegade

00:18:11.350 --> 00:18:14.870
Now, come at me, all at once!

00:18:15.620 --> 00:18:17.360
You've got spirit, at least.

00:18:17.360 --> 00:18:19.770
But you won't have it for much longer!

00:18:19.770 --> 00:18:22.280
Why not drop all the nonsense?

00:18:24.520 --> 00:18:28.620
Where's the fun in fighting a duel with 
such threatening expressions?

00:18:30.080 --> 00:18:31.360
Who are you?

00:18:31.750 --> 00:18:34.200
You're so serious, too...

00:18:34.680 --> 00:18:37.090
Duels aren't for picking fights.

00:18:37.090 --> 00:18:39.330
This is none of your business! Get lost!

00:18:39.330 --> 00:18:42.380
This is how we settle scores!

00:18:42.380 --> 00:18:44.910
Her duel started it, so that's how we'll get payback!

00:18:44.910 --> 00:18:47.840
But it's so boring. Far too boring...

00:18:47.840 --> 00:18:48.720
What was that?

00:18:48.720 --> 00:18:49.870
Damn you!

00:18:49.870 --> 00:18:51.540
Get down here!

00:18:51.820 --> 00:18:54.080
Settling scores, getting payback...

00:18:54.080 --> 00:18:56.380
Don't use duels for such things!

00:18:56.740 --> 00:18:58.800
Then what should I do?

00:18:58.800 --> 00:19:00.720
Just abandon my teammate?

00:19:01.640 --> 00:19:03.420
If you really must duel,

00:19:04.020 --> 00:19:05.900
let's have fun with it!

00:19:07.670 --> 00:19:11.230
I tribute Road Raven Renegade...

00:19:15.440 --> 00:19:20.170
To Tribute Summon Road Raven Red Queen.

00:19:28.410 --> 00:19:30.680
Road Raven Red Queen

00:19:32.800 --> 00:19:36.520
I activate Road Raven Red Queen's monster effect!

00:19:36.830 --> 00:19:39.150
Once per turn, its effect lets me

00:19:39.150 --> 00:19:42.820
gain control of all monsters on your side of the field.

00:19:53.620 --> 00:19:56.110
Damn, my monsters...

00:19:56.460 --> 00:19:59.210
The attack points of the monsters I gained control of

00:19:59.210 --> 00:20:01.210
become 100 until the end of my turn.

00:20:03.410 --> 00:20:06.320
I activate my spell card...

00:20:06.320 --> 00:20:08.820
...Smile World from my hand!

00:20:13.540 --> 00:20:17.520
This card increases the attack points 
of all monsters on the field

00:20:17.520 --> 00:20:21.210
by their total number multiplied by 100.

00:20:21.800 --> 00:20:24.240
There are currently three monsters on the field.

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:26.440
Thus, their attack points increase by 300!

00:20:35.300 --> 00:20:36.550
What's going on?

00:20:56.180 --> 00:20:56.970
Battle!

00:20:57.560 --> 00:21:01.660
I attack directly with Performapal Salutiger!

00:21:06.640 --> 00:21:10.140
You, too, Performapal Helpprincess! Get going!

00:21:19.460 --> 00:21:24.600
And last, Road Raven Red Queen!

00:21:44.850 --> 00:21:49.120
That man who appeared and saved my friend...

00:21:49.810 --> 00:21:51.320
That man was

00:21:52.200 --> 00:21:55.960
Yusyo Sakaki. Your father.

00:21:58.870 --> 00:22:01.870
The way he settled our fight, without any injuries,

00:22:02.500 --> 00:22:04.360
left me dumbstruck.

00:22:04.950 --> 00:22:07.060
He stole my heart away, too.

00:23:49.360 --> 00:23:53.360
Yuya... You found what lies beyond 
Pendulum and became stronger.

00:23:53.360 --> 00:23:54.950
But what will you do now?

00:23:55.510 --> 00:23:56.310
I...

00:23:57.160 --> 00:23:58.170
I...

00:23:59.010 --> 00:24:01.600
Ladies and gentlemen!

00:24:01.600 --> 00:24:03.690
You're about to watch the entertainment duels

00:24:03.690 --> 00:24:07.580
pioneered by Yusyo Sakaki, 
the You Show School's pride!

00:24:08.660 --> 00:24:13.830
Next time on Yu-Gi-Oh! ARC-V: 
A Duel of Smiles. "Smile World."

00:24:14.210 --> 00:24:16.390
The fun is only getting started!
